OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry at first. Rain,
OL,6,Fheavy at times, will spread east
OL,7,Fduring the morning. Becoming briefly
OL,8,Fdrier later in the afternoon before
OL,9,Ffrequent showers from the west. The
OL,10,Fwind will strengthen from the morning,
OL,11,Freaching gale to severe gale later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FVery windy with Storm Boelo
OL,14,Fbringing gales or severe gales and
OL,15,Ffrequent and occasionally heavy
OL,16,Fshowers from the west through the
OL,17,Fevening and overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
