OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStorm Boelo will bring severe
OL,6,Fgales and frequent heavy showers or
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain. Winds easing
OL,8,Fwith some drier interludes developing
OL,9,Flater.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,12,Fand bright morning Monday, becoming
OL,13,Fwindy with rain later. Very windy on
OL,14,FTuesday with showers, some heavy.
OL,15,FWinds easing overnight into Wednesday,
OL,16,Fthen bright spells and scattered
OL,17,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
